sequenceDiagram
  actor Rec as Recipient
  actor Staff as Blood Bank Staff
  participant UI as Browser (Thymeleaf pages)
  participant RC as RequestController
  participant RS as RequestService
  participant IS as InventoryService
  participant NS as NotificationService
  participant DB as MySQL

  Rec->>UI: Fill and submit blood request form
  UI->>RC: POST /requests/new (with CSRF token)
  RC->>RC: Validate form (@Valid)
  RC->>RS: create(form, user)
  RS->>DB: save request + status history (Pending)
  RS->>NS: notifyStaff (emergency or new request)
  NS->>DB: save notifications
  RC-->>UI: redirect to request details

  Staff->>UI: Choose status Approved, then Fulfilled
  UI->>RC: POST /requests/{id}/status
  RC->>RS: changeStatus(id, form, staff)
  RS->>RS: check role and allowed transition
  alt Fulfilled
    RS->>IS: issue(group, component, units)
    IS->>DB: lock usable batches, deduct earliest expiry first
    IS->>DB: save ISSUED transactions
    alt not enough stock
      IS-->>RS: BusinessException (transaction rolls back)
      RS-->>RC: error message
      RC-->>UI: show error, status unchanged
    end
  end
  RS->>DB: update status + history entry
  RS->>NS: notify requester
  RC-->>UI: redirect with success message
